<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Kissingen</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1866">1866</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war">Austro-Prussian War</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Kissingen was fought on 10 July 1866 at Bad Kissingen in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lower-franconia">Lower Franconia</a> during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war">Austro-Prussian War</a>. The Prussian Army of the Main defeated the Bavarian army, which was fighting on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a>'s side, and forced it back across the Franconian <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saale">Saale</a>. The defeat led <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bavaria">Bavaria</a> to make peace with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> and enter a secret military alliance with it.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-kissingen.jpg" alt="Battle of Kissingen" width="320" height="230" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Anonymer Verfasser · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sturm_der_Preu%C3%9Fen_%C3%BCber_die_Saalebr%C3%BCcke_auf_Kissingen_am_10._Juli.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>In the war of 1866 Bavaria fought for Austria and its troops were defeated by the Prussians at <b>Kissingen</b> in July.</blockquote><a href="/empire/kingdom-of-bavaria">Kingdom of Bavaria · Military</a></li></ul></section>
